# INVWINU.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY: a new item from
# the item list.  INS opens the form; OK with no category is refused at
# Category; a location that does not exist is refused before the save,
# "No location" under the fields and the focus on Location; with a good
# one the item is added and the list shows it, then its form, unsnapped:
# its Created and Updated dates are the test machine's clock's.
# TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINU.SNP is its snapshot.
# The messages and the focus are those of WFORMTL and WFORMTC.
T ADMIN
K TAB
T Retro1986
K ENTER
S LIST
K INS
S NEW
K ENTER
S NOCAT
T SYS
# Category, Maker by its letter, Model, then Location by its letter
K ALT-M
T Commodore
K TAB
T PET 2001
K ALT-L
T ZZ
K ENTER
S BADLOC
T B2
# OK adds item 4: the dialog ends and the list shows it.
K ENTER
S ADDED
# the new item, in view mode
K END ENTER
K ENTER
S DONE
